From: Eric Nelson <eric.nelson-Q5RJGjKts06CY9SHAMCTRUEOCMrvLtNR@public.gmane.org>
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] ARM: dts: sabrelite: use simple-panel instead of display-timings for LVDS0
